{{also|imperméable}}
==English==

===Etymology===
Apparently from {{prefix|en|im|permeable}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=adj|id=9822174863}}</ref> Compare {{cog|fr|imperméable}}, from {{cog|la|impermeābilis}}, from {{m|la|in-|im-}} + {{m|la|permeābilis|t=permeable}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ɪmˈpɜːɹmɪəbəl/}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-impermeable.wav|a=Southern England}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Impossible to [[permeate]].
# Not allowing [[passage]], especially of [[liquid]]s; [[waterproof]].

